 "note": {
  "status": "draft",
  "text": "Words about disease:\n• an outbreak: the sudden start of a disease in an area; to spread; contagious (passed from person to person); an infection; a germ (a virus or bacterium);\n• symptoms: signs of a disease (fever, cough, headache, tiredness); to diagnose: to find out what disease someone has;\n• to isolate / isolation: to keep a sick person away from others; quarantine: keeping people who may be infected apart for some days;\n• a vaccine: a substance that protects the body against a disease; to vaccinate; immunity;\n• hygiene: keeping clean to stay healthy; sanitizer; a face mask; social distancing.",
  "checks": []
 },
